    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated on Knader Road in Ballyshannon, this three bedroom property offers a traditional layout and excellent potential for refurbishment. The home features a separate sitting room and kitchen, providing clear definition between living and dining spaces and a solid foundation for modern redesign.\n\nThis property is an ideal opportunity for buyers seeking a project with scope to add significant value. The accommodation includes three well proportioned bedrooms, offering flexibility for family living, guest rooms, or home office use.\n\nWith its convenient location close to Ballyshannon`s amenities, schools, and transport links, this residence presents a strong prospect for those looking to create a home tailored to their own taste or investors seeking a renovation project in a well established area.\n\nThis is a property with genuine potential for transformation, offering the chance to reimagine and modernise a home in a sought after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.8m (9'2\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted\n\n - 5.8m (19'0\") x 0.9m (2'11\")\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m (15'5\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nWalls Papered, Carpet Flooring, 1no. Window, Solid Fuel Stove\n\nKitchen - 4.7m (15'5\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nWalls painted, Floors tiled, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, French Doors, High & Low level units tiled between, Wash hand basin, Eletric Hob & Oven\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.1m (10'2\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nBedroom 2 - 3m (9'10\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m (11'10\") x 3m (9'10\")\nWalls painted, Floors Carpeted, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator\n\nBathroom - 3m (9'10\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\nWalls painted, Floors tiled, 1no. Window, 1no. Radiator, Wash hand basin, WC, Electric Shower\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
